{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12225410","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12225410","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1222541001:1":{"text":"타시, 우리가 도와줄 사람을 찾아서 돌아왔어요!","source_cn":"塔西，我们叫帮手回来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF634DE878A429B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222541002:1":{"text":"흐흐흐, 어디 보자. 표적으로 쓸 악마가 어디에 있을까?","source_cn":"嚯嚯嚯，让我看看，用来当靶子的恶魔在哪呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DBAE8AEDF5FEE39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222541003:1":{"text":"...저 나비야? 소니아 말로는 악마는 상어처럼 생겼다고 했는데?","source_cn":"……是这个？索尼娅说那恶魔像鲨鱼，但这个明显是蝴蝶。还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4B8ABA3059F4E64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222541004:0":{"text":"...<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>! 이 사람은 누구죠?!","source_cn":"——<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x11CBE705045BA723","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>! 이 사람은 누구죠?!","female":"...<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>! 이 사람은 누구죠?!","variant_male_record_index":"136837","variant_female_record_index":"136838","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222541005:1":{"text":"거칠고 경솔하고, 무례해요! 제가 어딜 봐서 악마 같다는 거죠? 저는 꿈을 지키는 요정이라고요!","source_cn":"粗野，鲁莽，没礼貌！我哪里像恶魔？我是守护梦境的妖精！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA140E2D7C225D20A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222541006:0":{"text":"당신이 서 있는 이 땅, 그리고 반짝이는 “드림 아일랜드” 전체가 전부 제가 짠 꿈이에요. 이렇게 귀여운 저를 그 더럽고 야만스러운 악마랑 헷갈리다니!","source_cn":"你脚下站的地面，还有整个闪闪发光的藏梦岛，都是我编织的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x163DF2537ED8F078","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222541007:1":{"text":"요정? 오오오! 요정의 가루는 가볍고 마력을 품은 특별한 재료지! 심지어 수도의 대장장이조차 많이 갖고 있지 않다던데.","source_cn":"妖精？妖精也稀奇！我听说妖精洒下的粉末是轻盈又含魔力的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64503BDD1C5726A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222541008:0":{"text":"악마를 처리하고 나면 재료를 좀 나눠줄 수 없나?","source_cn":"等处理完恶魔的需求，分点材料让我试试呗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8C9D49F55C0CCBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222541009:0":{"text":"...다가오지 마요! 날개 가루를 가져가려고 하다니, 정말 무례하네요!","source_cn":"——不要靠近我！竟然还想取我翅膀上的磷粉，真是太野蛮了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FA9E0B78CB07143","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222541010:0":{"text":"꼬마야, 이 후긴 님이 만든 대포로 악마를 날려버리고 나면 너도 내가 믿을만한 드워프라고 생각하게 될 거야!","source_cn":"孩子，等用呼金炮把那个恶魔轰飞，你就会对勤勉踏实的矮人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6B344E6E929CF2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222541011:0":{"text":"꼬마?! 당신이 저보다 작잖아요! 그리고 제가 당신보다 나이가 많다고요. 그것도 아주!","source_cn":"孩子？！你明明比我还矮！而且我岁数比你大！大很多很多！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FFC5DAD9B6EB183","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1222541011":{"text":"꼬마?! 당신이 저보다 작잖아요! 그리고 제가 당신보다 나이가 많다고요. 그것도 아주!","source_cn":"孩子？！你明明比我还矮！而且我岁数比你大！大很多很多！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FFC5DAD9B6EB183","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222541012:0":{"text":"그래, 그래. 잊지 마. 우리가 상대해야 하는 건 악마라고!","source_cn":"好了好了，别忘了，我们是来对付恶魔的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA5DE854340BCBFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1222541013:0":{"text":"첫인상은 별로여도, 후긴의 기술은 확실히 믿을 만해.","source_cn":"虽然初次会面不太愉快，但我可以担保，呼金的技艺绝对值得信赖。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF6E67303B9EE95C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1222541014:1":{"text":"데빌 샤크를 이기게 해줄 수 있는 최고의 지원군이지!","source_cn":"他是我们击败鲨鱼恶魔最好的助力！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08E2120BA9601F1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1222541015:0":{"text":"흥... 쳇!","source_cn":"哼……唔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA605CBDDE958EEF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1222541016:0":{"text":"여러분이 데리고 온 사람이니까, 어쩔 수 없죠! 저 사람이랑 기계 장치가 꿈에 들어오는 걸 허락해 줄게요.","source_cn":"既然是你们带来的人，我就勉为其难地准许他和他的机械造物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E9B9A49C903B1EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1222541017:0":{"text":"흐흐. 시간을 꽤 지체했군. 그래서, 진짜 표적은 어디에 있지? 아이언 헤드와 로우 그라운드가 기다리다 지쳤다고!","source_cn":"嚯嚯，耽误了不少时间。真正的靶子在哪里，铁头和矮地他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BB262A497C3B527","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1222541018:1":{"text":"나침반으로 한번 볼게.","source_cn":"让我用罗盘瞧瞧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75B1170FCC9E8906","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:27::2":{"text":"나침반","source_cn":"罗盘","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39BF68A0B410B505","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:30::0":{"text":"신밧드의 나침반","source_cn":"辛巴达的罗盘","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C7EDD1BF5B2E0CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1222541019:0":{"text":"이 방향은... 여전히 <style=\"highlight\">순풍의 자리</style>에 있는 것 같네.","source_cn":"这个方位……看起来他还在<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDC530DCE75E7203","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1222541020:0":{"text":"크하하하, 가자! 악마에게 우리의 힘을 보여주자고!","source_cn":"嚯哈哈哈，走！让那个恶魔瞧瞧我们的厉害！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA3C1CDA61A34447","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1222541021:0":{"text":"후긴 성격은 정말 불같네요...","source_cn":"呼金真是风风火火……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36C149557744C60C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1222541022:0":{"text":"의욕이 넘쳐요!","source_cn":"干劲满满！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4C17D13627F2DDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1222541023:1":{"text":"우리도 빨리 따라가자. 후긴이 혹시라도 섬의 다른 것에 대포를 시험하려고 하면 울머스의 상황이 더 심각해질 거야!","source_cn":"咱们也快跟上，要是呼金一时兴起用岛上其他东西试炮，奥曼...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7CAB27BC7788A78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1222541024:0":{"text":"저기! 다들 조심해요. 절대로 적을 얕보면 안 돼요!","source_cn":"喂——你们大家都小心呀！别轻敌！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EF5AA5D6E3E7E7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1222541025:0":{"text":"제발... 무사히 돌아왔으면 좋겠어요.","source_cn":"真是的……希望他们能平安归来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD44B81EEBD95628B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1222541026:0":{"text":"울머스 할아버지, 좀 어때요? 할아버지의 꿈을 이 세상의 재미있는 것들로 채우기 위해서 최선을 다할게요.","source_cn":"奥曼斯爷爷，你感觉怎么样？我会尽力用世界上所有好玩的东...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x779BA15414C2E21E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1222541027:0":{"text":"악마에게 지지 말아요, 의식을 삼키게 두지 말라고요!","source_cn":"不要输给那个讨厌的恶魔，不要被他吞噬意识！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x754BBC4B71D6D398","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1222541028:0":{"text":"버텨야 해요...","source_cn":"坚持住……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x091657FDB42A7CC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:0:1":{"text":"후긴의 대포로 악마를 상대할 거야","source_cn":"我们准备用呼金的炮对付恶魔","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC857B313D10AF2C9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"후긴의 대포로 악마를 상대할 거야","female":"후긴의 대포로 악마를 상대할 거야","variant_male_record_index":"66754","variant_female_record_index":"66755","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:1:2":{"text":"둘이 너무 안 맞네...","source_cn":"天性不合啊……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2EF234E814EBDAA8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"둘이 너무 안 맞네...","female":"둘이 너무 안 맞네...","variant_male_record_index":"66756","variant_female_record_index":"66757","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:2:3":{"text":"“그만! 싸우지 마!!”","source_cn":"“谁都不许吵架！”","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6D82D29D3BD74D5F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"“그만! 싸우지 마!!”","female":"“그만! 싸우지 마!!”","variant_male_record_index":"66758","variant_female_record_index":"66759","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:呼金":{"text":"후긴","source":"呼金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:塔西":{"text":"타시","source":"塔西","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stat